```uvl
// PC Configuration Tool - UVL Code

// Components & Requirements

// CPU
// - Intel vs. AMD - Determines Motherboard Socket
// - CPU Selection: Intel vs. AMD

// Motherboard
// - Chipset: Z790
// - Motherboard Socket: LGA 1700
// - Motherboard Form Factor: ATX

// RAM
// - DDR4 or DDR5 - Dependent on CPU
// - RAM Type: DDR4 or DDR5

// Graphics Card
// - High-end GPU (e.g., RTX 4090)
// - Minimum Power Requirement: 850W
// - GPU Length: 350mm
// - Case Compatibility: Must match GPU Clearance

// Case
// - Case Form Factor: ATX
// - Case Compatibility: Must match Motherboard Form Factor

// Optional
// - Large Air Cooler: Height must be less than CPU Cooler Clearance

// Constraints
// - CPU Selection & Motherboard Socket are mutually exclusive
// - GPU Selection & Case Compatibility are mutually exclusive
// - RAM Type & Case Compatibility are mutually exclusive

// Output:
// - CPU: Intel vs. AMD
// - Motherboard: LGA 1700
// - RAM: DDR4 or DDR5
// - GPU: RTX 4090
// - Case: ATX
// - Cooler: Large Air Cooler
// - CPU Cooler Clearance: 350mm
// - Motherboard Clearance: 350mm

// Alternative representation using keywords:
// CPU { 'type' => 'Intel' | 'AMD' }
// Motherboard { 'form_factor' => 'ATX' }
// RAM { 'type' => 'DDR4' | 'DDR5' }
// GPU { 'power_requirement' => '850W' }
// Case { 'form_factor' => 'ATX' }
// Cooler { 'height' => '350mm' }
// CPU Cooler Clearance { 'height' => '350mm' }
// Motherboard Clearance { 'height' => '350mm' }
//

// Additional Notes:
// - This code focuses on the essential constraints. A more complex UVL program could include more detailed constraints (e.g., specific RAM speeds, CPU core counts, etc.).
// - The provided constraints are mutually exclusive.
// - The code assumes a standard case form factor.
```